{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wujing was originally a great general of the Heavenly Roller Shutter, but was demoted to the Liusha River due to accidentally breaking a glass cup. Every seven days, he would suffer the pain of ten thousand swords piercing through his heart. As time goes by, Wujing's inner self gradually darkens. He no longer silently endures pain, but seeks to explore the truth behind the workings of this world in order to redeem himself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/770c3e365f8e7dc81ff2cd930065fff5.poster.avif?t=1772679041\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/770c3e365f8e7dc81ff2cd930065fff5.webm?t=1772679041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/770c3e365f8e7dc81ff2cd930065fff5.mp4?t=1772679041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: This is a dungeon adventure game. Players will lead their team to scavenge for treasures in the dark dungeons or encounter various random events. Players can obtain medicines, equipment, skill books, and gear to enhance the strength of their team. When players encounter enemies, they will enter turn-based combat. They can use the summon command to summon spirit beasts to help them fight, or use the recall command to withdraw the spirit beast from the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During non-combat times, players can use skill scrolls to teach their spirit beasts new skills, or utilize cultivation pills to enhance the attributes of their spirit beasts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/d261ee40da42155a8995e75efba00e02.poster.avif?t=1772679041\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/d261ee40da42155a8995e75efba00e02.webm?t=1772679041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/d261ee40da42155a8995e75efba00e02.mp4?t=1772679041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>easts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728380?t=1772679041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728380?t=1772679041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/08719614582c72310f4eec2c501005a46628e138/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772679041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/08719614582c72310f4eec2c501005a46628e138/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772679041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4356600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wujing was originally a great general of the Heavenly Roller Shutter, but was demoted to the Liusha River due to accidentally breaking a glass cup. Every seven days, he would suffer the pain of ten thousand swords piercing through his heart. As time goes by, Wujing's inner self gradually darkens. He no longer silently endures pain, but seeks to explore the truth behind the workings of this world in order to redeem himself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/770c3e365f8e7dc81ff2cd930065fff5.poster.avif?t=1772679041\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/770c3e